  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the circle whose radius is <math><mn>5</mn></math> units and which touches the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> externally at the point <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
