  "solution": {
    "text": "The equation of the given circle is<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0058_f28f2d4e1f16.png\" style=\"width:2.7in;height:1.2in\" /><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Its centre is <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and radius <math><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />The circle touches another circle of radius <math><mn>5</mn></math> externally at&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Let its centre be <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br />Clearly, <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is the midpoint of <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math> Therefore,<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br />Hence, the equation of the required circle is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />or, <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>"
  }
